 (unfinished)

Peripheral Pretender v0, part B, interrupted before verification. The
mchp-sercom (USART mode) and mchp-port devices are written but not yet
selected by PIC32CM_JH_SOC, not added to the SoC model table, and not
built or tested. Remaining work is listed in the Peripheral Pretender
repo (docs/handoff.md and the qemu-core-b progress log).

Peripheral Pretender downstream patch; not for upstream submission.

